    "description": {
      "value": "This beautiful leather bag is lined in soft fur and purrs quietly when pet.\n\n- **Activate:** 2 Actions\n- **Frequency:** once per day\n\nYou shake the bag to produce a single cat. You cast a 3rd-level summon animal to produce a leopard (Bestiary 52).\n\n- **Activate:** 2 Actions\n- **Frequency:** once per day\n\nYou pull the bag over your head and it covers you completely. You then exit the bag in the form of a large cat.\n\nYou gain the effects of 3rd-level animal form but must use the cat battle form."
